      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I strongly advise against starting a 5000mg loading dose without direct medical supervision, as bypassing established guidelines is risky for kidney health. Your body's ability to manage high levels of Vitamin C and resulting oxalate load is highly individual and unpredictable. Instead of self-prescribing a \"reset,\" focus on implementing proven dietary changes and hydration strategies while seeking a second opinion from a specialist who focuses on nephrology.",
